CM_ "Maserati GranCabrio 2016 (M145, 4.7 L F136 V8, ZF 6HP26), CAN bus on OBD-II pins 6/14, 500 kbit/s, 11-bit IDs. Reverse-engineered on ONE car by passive listening; see docs/signals.md for the evidence and confidence of every signal.";
CM_ SG_ 97 BrakePressed "Brake pedal. Medium-high confidence: never set while the engine load is high (0 of 327 samples), always set at standstill. Not yet ruled out: 'brake OR stopped'. Same bit also appears in 0x146 byte0 bit3 and 0x3A1 byte2 bit4.";
CM_ SG_ 203 GearEngaged "Gear actually engaged, high 3 bits of byte 4. 1..6 = gear, 7 = neutral / no gear (seen only at standstill), 0 = engine not running (0x361 is not broadcast then). Verified by speed/rpm ratio clusters: 3rd->4th step 1.332 vs ZF 6HP26 1.331. Reverse not yet observed. Byte 4 bit 4 is usually 1; 0x60 (3, bit 4 clear) also occurs - meaning unknown.";
CM_ BO_ 204 "5-byte frame, 48 Hz (measured with a full-rate logger).";
CM_ SG_ 204 SteeringWheelAngle "Steering wheel angle, positive = left. Centre reads -5 counts (offset +0.5 deg applied). Full lock +5449 / -5459 counts = +/-545 deg, 3.03 turns lock to lock. Verified on the car.";
CM_ SG_ 326 VehicleSpeed "Vehicle speed. r=0.999 vs the head unit's decoded speed, mean error 0.40 km/h; divisor 128 confirmed independently by the gearbox ratio step and by the trip counter (10.05 m per count).";
CM_ BO_ 358 "Raw value drops to 0x002C (44) for all four wheels when the car is stationary. Treat any raw value < 0x2000 as invalid.";
CM_ SG_ 358 WheelSpeed_RR "Rear right. r=0.9998 vs vehicle speed after removing the invalid state. Left/right assignment: high confidence (outer wheels faster in turns). Front/rear assignment: medium-high (inferred from turning geometry).";
CM_ SG_ 358 WheelSpeed_RL "Rear left. See WheelSpeed_RR.";
CM_ SG_ 358 WheelSpeed_FR "Front right. See WheelSpeed_RR.";
CM_ SG_ 358 WheelSpeed_FL "Front left. See WheelSpeed_RR.";
CM_ SG_ 865 EngineLoad "Medium-high confidence. Idle ~20 % (raw 52), coasting ~12 % (raw 31), heavy throttle ~51 % (raw 130); never overlaps with BrakePressed. Looks like calculated load rather than raw pedal position.";
CM_ SG_ 865 EngineSpeed "Engine speed. Mean error 21 rpm with the 17/16 factor (74 rpm with factor 1). Origin of the 17/16 factor unknown, but the gearbox ratio check depends on it and matches.";
CM_ SG_ 1376 TripCounter "Distance counter in byte 7, 1 count = 10 m (measured 10.05 m), +1 per step. Use differences, not the absolute value. Width beyond 8 bits unknown (never exceeded 0xB0 in our logs; byte 6 bits 0-1 never seen set). Byte 6 carries flags, NOT counter bits: 0x04 / 0x08 appear briefly while driving, 0x20 while the counter is reset/not running (whole of a stationary idle, end of a drive with byte 7 = 0).";
CM_ SG_ 1382 VehicleSpeed2 "Second speed source. r=0.997, mean error 0.66 km/h.";
CM_ SG_ 1409 EngineOilTemp "Engine oil temperature, ~90 % confidence. Found in a cold-start recording: starts at ambient, lags coolant, plateaus near coolant temperature and stays at 87-90 degC under load (oil cooler thermostat). The same value is repeated in 0x561 byte3, 0x061 byte3 and 0x081 byte4. The ECU does not answer OBD PID 0x5C on this car.";
CM_ SG_ 1889 CoolantTemp "Engine coolant temperature, standard OBD encoding. Matches the dashboard gauge (90 on a 130 scale) and the thermostat plateau of 87-89 degC.";
CM_ SG_ 1889 CoolantTemp2 "Redundant copy of CoolantTemp (differs by at most 1 degC).";

VAL_ 97 BrakePressed 0 "Released" 1 "Pressed" ;
VAL_ 203 GearEngaged 0 "Engine not running" 7 "Neutral / none" ;
VAL_ 358 WheelSpeed_RR 44 "Invalid (stationary)" ;
VAL_ 358 WheelSpeed_RL 44 "Invalid (stationary)" ;
VAL_ 358 WheelSpeed_FR 44 "Invalid (stationary)" ;
VAL_ 358 WheelSpeed_FL 44 "Invalid (stationary)" ;
